//==== begin Api.mqh ====
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
//| QT/Api.mqh — signed HTTPS calls to the Quant Terminal Edge        |
//| Functions. Signature = hex HMAC-SHA256(secret, ts + "\n" + body), |
